      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "My dear boy, my smile is forever locked in this photograph. Years may
    dim many old moments, yet my love for you will never blur or vanish. No matter
    how much memory you lose, I will always dwell quietly inside your heart. Don\u2019t
    feel lost or lonely. I am always with you through every passing day, guarding
    you gently for all time."
