      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Flipping through these old diary pages, every bit of my childhood unfolds
    clearly before my eyes. I can feel the joy and troubles I once had back then.
    Sadly, there is no record of my family beside these trivial daily stories. Though
    I only salvage the old version of myself from these words, these sincere records
    are solid proof of how I grew up step by step.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
